  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/NZzxdkrV4s\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/21f178aff2b64844fefeaf94a3a3a418440fd43f.png\" alt=\"「LopyMine's Project」Discord 伺服器連結\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/LopyMine/mossylib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d87060a9e4522786e45b4b54d10853a1b4a91b10.png\" alt=\"GitHub 連結橫幅\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fboosty.to%252flopymine%252fdonate\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dce91fef079649dee277c52a998fc068e745e99e.png\" alt=\"贊助連結橫幅\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mossylib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c39affcb732c8b1a4fe189e79898c686da3d63e2.png\" alt=\"CurseForge 連結橫幅\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmossylib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9991553f6a20e5105b9b153b8d817bc3630c18a8.png\" alt=\"Modrinth 連結橫幅\"></a></p>\n<h2>說明</h2>\n<p><strong>MossyLib</strong> 是一個簡潔的函式庫，內建了我所有模組所需的共用程式碼。這確實大幅簡化了我的模組開發流程，讓開發速度更快、效率更高。</p>\n<h3>包含項目：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>專為我的模組打造的 YACL 主題</li>\n<li>實用工具集</li>\n<li>現成的多版本與多載入器相容程式碼（支援 Fabric 與 (Neo)Forge）</li>\n</ul>",
